 "data": [
  {
   "uuid": "22ca3ca2-1bdc-48a7-8689-a0f8259a5441",
   "slug": "bolide",
   "name": "Bolide",
   "class_name": "POWR_AEGS_S02_Bolide_SCItem",
   "classification": "Ship.PowerPlant.Power",
   "classification_label": "Power",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "The Bolide power plant from Aegis has logged innumerable hours of flight experience and is frequently used by the UEE Navy and security forces across the Empire.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: Aegis Dynamics\nTyp (En): Power Plant\nTyp (De): Energiegenerator\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\nG\u00fctegrad: B\nKlasse: Military (Milit\u00e4r)\n\nDas Bolide Power Plant von Aegis hat eine umfangreiche Flugerfahrung und wird oft von der UEE-Navy und den Sicherheitskr\u00e4ften im gesamten Imperium genutzt.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u53d1\u7535\u673a\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u5723\u76fe\u52a8\u529b\uff08Aegis Dynamics\uff09\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aB\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u519b\u7528\n\n\u6765\u81ea\u5723\u76fe\u7684\u706b\u6d41\u661f\u53d1\u7535\u673a\u62e5\u6709\u65e0\u6570\u5c0f\u65f6\u7684\u98de\u884c\u7ecf\u9a8c\uff0c\u5728UEE\u6d77\u519b\u548c\u6574\u4e2a\u5e1d\u56fd\u7684\u5b89\u5168\u90e8\u961f\u4e2d\u5341\u5206\u5e38\u7528\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : G\u00e9n\u00e9rateur\nFabricant : Aegis Dynamics\nTaille : 2\nQualit\u00e9 : B\nClasse : Militaire\n\nLa centrale \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique Bolide de Aegis a enregistr\u00e9 d'innombrables heures d'exp\u00e9rience de vol et est fr\u00e9quemment utilis\u00e9e par la Marine de l'UEE et les forces de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 \u00e0 travers l'Empire."
   },
