  {
   "uuid": "cfe4539d-2066-4317-8d52-cba38ac3767e",
   "slug": "celestial",
   "name": "Celestial",
   "class_name": "POWR_SASU_S03_Celestial_SCItem",
   "classification": "Ship.PowerPlant.Power",
   "classification_label": "Power",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "The Celestial from Sakura Sun improves upon the company's base large power plant by redesigning the power rate and other key aspects to raise the component's overall performance.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: Sakura Sun\nTyp (En): Power Plant\nTyp (De): Energiegenerator\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S3\nG\u00fctegrad: B\nKlasse: Civilian (Zivil)\n\nDer Celestial von Sakura Sun verbessert das einfache gro\u00dfen Power Plant des Unternehmens durch eine Neugestaltung der Leistungsrate und anderer wichtiger Aspekte die Gesamtleistung der Komponente steigern.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u53d1\u7535\u673a\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u6a31\u65e5\u96c6\u56e2 (Sakura Sun)\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a3\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aB\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u6c11\u7528\n\n\u6a31\u65e5\u96c6\u56e2\u7684\"\u5929\u4f53\"\u901a\u8fc7\u91cd\u65b0\u8bbe\u8ba1\u8f93\u51fa\u529f\u7387\u548c\u5176\u4ed6\u5173\u952e\u5185\u5bb9\u6765\u6539\u5584\u8be5\u516c\u53f8\u7684\u5927\u578b\u53d1\u7535\u673a\uff0c\u7528\u4ee5\u63d0\u9ad8\u7ec4\u4ef6\u7684\u6574\u4f53\u6027\u80fd\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : G\u00e9n\u00e9rateur\nFabricant : Sakura Sun\nTaille : 3\nQualit\u00e9 : B\nClasse : Civile\n\nLe mod\u00e8le Celestial de Sakura Sun am\u00e9liore la centrale \u00e9lectrique de base de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 en repensant le taux de puissance et d'autres aspects cl\u00e9s pour augmenter la performance globale du composant."
   },
